<div class="axyum-page">
  <h2 class="axyum-page-title">Welcome to LD Axyum</h2>
  <p class="axyum-page-description">
    A next-generation character creation system for D&D 5e. This wizard will guide you through creating a fully realized character with all abilities, skills, and equipment calculated automatically.
  </p>

  <div style="margin-top: 2rem; padding: 2rem; background: rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.05); border-left: 4px solid var(--axyum-primary); border-radius: 6px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Quick Tips:</h3>
    <ul style="margin: 0;">
      <li>Follow the 12-page wizard in order (or jump back to any page anytime)</li>
      <li>Your choices automatically calculate ability modifiers, hit points, and other stats</li>
      <li>You can edit your choices on the Summary page before creating your character</li>
      <li>All character data is drawn from official D&D 5e rules and compendia</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem; background: rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.15); border: 2px solid rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.5); border-radius: 6px;">
    <p style="margin: 0 0 0.8rem 0; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: bold; color: #e74c3c;">
      <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i> IMPORTANT: Configure Your Content Sources
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 0.8rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem;">
      Before creating your first character, you MUST select which compendia to use. By default, NO compendia are enabled to give you full control over your content.
    </p>
    <button type="button" class="configure-compendia-btn" data-action="configureCompendia" style="padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e74c3c, #c0392b); border: none; border-radius: 4px; color: white; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; transition: all 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.3);">
      <i class="fas fa-cog"></i> Configure Compendia Now
    </button>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
    <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: #666;">
      <strong>Ready to begin?</strong> Click "Next" to start building your character!
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
